         <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>1735689600</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>
         <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>April 2025</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>
         <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>
         <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>1743465600</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>
         <rms:rms_experience_1_description>Orchestrated the setup and operation of flotation lines for large-scale juice clarification, managing flow rates and gas injection for optimal turbidity levels.&#xA;Monitored fermentation kinetics, executing precise chemical additions (yeast, nutrients, acid) to ensure product quality specifications were met.&#xA;Maintained cellar hygiene protocols during peak intake, ensuring sterile transfer lines and safe handling of winery chemicals.</rms:rms_experience_1_description>
         <rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>
         <rms:rms_experience_1_location>Griffith, NSW, Australia</rms:rms_experience_1_location>
         <rms:rms_experience_1_role>Flotation Operator &amp; Cellar Hand</rms:rms_experience_1_role>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_company>CASELLA FAMILY BRANDS (Peter Lehmann Wines)</rms:rms_experience_2_company>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>January 2024</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>1704067200</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>May 2024</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>1714521600</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_description>Operated within the chilling and cellar team during a high-pressure vintage, handlingpump overs, rackings, and transfers.&#xA;Managed oak barrel operations including filling, emptying, and high-pressure cleaning/sanitizing.&#xA;Ensured efficient tanker loading/unloading while strictly adhering to WHS (WorkHealth Safety) regulations.</rms:rms_experience_2_description>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_location>Tanunda, SA, Australia</rms:rms_experience_2_location>
         <rms:rms_experience_2_role>Cellar Hand</rms:rms_experience_2_role>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_company>MATUA (Treasury Wine Estates)</rms:rms_experience_3_company>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_dateBegin>February 2023</rms:rms_experience_3_dateBegin>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_3_dateBeginFormat>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_dateBeginTS>1675209600</rms:rms_experience_3_dateBeginTS>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_dateEnd>May 2023</rms:rms_experience_3_dateEnd>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndFormat>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndTS>1682899200</rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndTS>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_description>Specialized in white wine processing, operating both continuous and batch flotation units to ensure clean juice for fermentation.&#xA;Led equipment sanitation (CIP) for tanks and lines, ensuring rapid turnaround timesduring heavy harvest intake.&#xA;Mentored junior staff on safety procedures and operational standards during nightshifts.</rms:rms_experience_3_description>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_3_isCurrent>
         <rms:rms_experience_3_location>Blenheim, New Zealand</rms:rms_experience_3_location>
